  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb with o→ue stem change",
    "Stem change applies in presente (all forms except nosotros/nosotras): *acuesto, acuestas, acuesta, acuestan*",
    "No stem change in pretérito indefinido (-AR verbs never change in preterite)",
    "Subjuntivo nosotros reverts to infinitive stem: *nos acostemos* (not *\\*acuestemos*)",
    "Past participle: acostado (regular)",
    "*Me acuesto a las once* = I go to bed at eleven",
    "Non-reflexive: *acostar* = to put (someone) to bed; *Acostó al niño* = She put the child to bed",
    "Related: la cama (bed), el sueño (sleep/dream), dormirse (to fall asleep), despertarse (to wake up)"
  ],
